Z||000003||JSocha||05-26-2001||10:15 AM||||The only thing they order/had was the front drivers side outer marker light socket which they replaced.  Then they traced a bad wire to my rear PONTIAC lights and fixed that.<P>I'm waiting for and I ordered the following:<P>(FS) = Fiero Store<BR>(P) = Pondski<P>Altenator (FS) $104.76<BR>O2 Sensor (FS)   35.12<BR>Exhaust Manifold (P)  ??<BR>Temp/Fuel Guage  (P)  ??<P>and a tranny for $300 from Strege Auto with a 100K miles on it.<P>When I get my other tranny out, my brother and I are going to rebuild it this winter (as part of an exchange for doing his website for their resort <A HREF="http://www.twinoaks4fun.com)." TARGET=_blank>www.twinoaks4fun.com).</A>   <P>That way, if this tranny goes I will have the original ready to go back in and he and I can do it as he is more auto mechanically inclined then what I am.  $300 I thought was better then $1,625 for a rebuilt out of Minot where they also end up taking my tranny with no reduction in price.<P>All in all, $500/550 in parts.  The labor is what is going to get me.  Approx: $4-500 to replace the exhaust manifold, Altenator, temp/fuel guage and O2 Sensor and about $8-900 to replace the tranny.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||V8Fiero||05-26-2001||03:28 PM||||Hey Jeff,<P>I took the liberty of making sure they were taking good care of your car. During work this morning I took a drive through the lot. <P>Geezzz...<BR>You would think they would at least wash the car for ya....was a little dusty.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Good luck dealing with those guys. Ever since they sold out, Ive heard bad things.<P>Scott||||reg||1
Z||000005||JSocha||05-26-2001||06:06 PM||||Thanks V8.  Have to get up there someday soon and take a look at your wheels.  Maybe next weekend when hopefully all the parts have come in for mine.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||JSocha||06-22-2001||01:24 PM||||"Up from the bowels of heck!"<P>Had to dig around to find this thread.<P>Anyways ladies and gentleman, tonight, after work, going to pick her up.  She's done.<P>New 02 sensor, front exhaust manifold, temp/fuel guage, new altenator, 'rebuilt' tranny (an Izuzu 5 speed was sent where they thought it was a Muncie because of the tranny codes and the other rebuilt I originally could have gotten was sold), wheel alignment and a small repair to the parking light socket and she is done.<P>Right around the 4K mark with the parts that I got plus the labor and stuff they did.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>This year, when she would otherwise be ready to go into cold storage, I'm sending her to the spa...err...body shop for the winter to get a fresh coat of paint, possibly from a complete teardown...so next spring, summer and fall...she's as good as new!<P>Ain't she a beauty?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||V8Fiero||06-22-2001||03:43 PM||||Hey Jeff!<P>Stop by when you are in town. I need to show off my new (to me) 86 GT that I got from the Fiero Warehouse. Just about ready to drop the seized engine and replace with a running one. Hopefully will have it running Sunday afternoon.<P>Scott||||reg||1
Z||000008||JSocha||06-23-2001||12:52 AM||||Scott,<P>Hey man!  Sorry.  Didn't get your message until just now.  We were pressed for time.  Had to be in Harvey by 7:30 to look at a horse buggy and some other stuff and get the wife home so she could get to bed as she has to work tomorrow.<P>I have to call Fisher tomorrow, since the service department was closed and find out what they did with the altenator and a few other parts that I told them to put in my trunk.  May have to shoot up there tomorrow if Pat is in, otherwise sometime next week.<P>I do want to see your new Fiero!  I'll call when I'm headed that way and when I know I am not pressed for time.<P>Later!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
